App_konference is a channel-independent, high-performance conference
application for Asterisk. It features efficient audio mixing as well as
video selection based on VAD, DTMF or CLI.

This port builds the module (app_konference.so) against an installed
Asterisk 20 LTS (net/asterisk20). Both ULAW and ALAW are enabled for
parity with production (ALAW trunks are common in Ukraine).

Source: pjalbrecht/appkonference (GitHub), pinned commit for reproducible
builds across hosts.
